# 1. Purpose

The purpose of this System Objective Specification (SOS) is to formally define the engineering objectives that the Adaptive Vehicle Intelligence Architecture (AVIA) system is required to achieve.

This document establishes solution-independent system objectives that describe the intended outcomes of the engineered system without prescribing specific technologies, components, algorithms, or implementation methods.

The SOS provides the authoritative engineering foundation from which all subsequent system requirements, engineering architectures, analyses, designs, verification activities, and validation efforts shall be derived.

By maintaining clear objective definition and complete traceability, this document ensures that engineering development remains aligned with the approved Project Charter and the established engineering philosophy of the AVIA project.
